OL,3,GNEWSAKey commuter routes could see
OL,4,A20mph zones imposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of key commuter routes could see
OL,7,F20mph speed limits imposed in a bid to
OL,8,Freduce serious collisions.
OL,10,FBristol City Council is considering
OL,11,Fintroducing the new rules on about 90
OL,12,Froads, covering 56 miles (90km).
OL,13,FCouncillors will debate the plans at a
OL,14,Fmeeting on Thursday and the new speeds
OL,15,Fcould be rolled out by summer 2027.
OL,17,FThe routes include Bond Street, the A4
OL,18,FBath Road, Church Road, Winterstoke
OL,19,FRoad, Coronation Road, Westbury Road,
OL,20,FTemple Gate, Anchor Road and Hotwell
OL,21,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
