OL,3,GNEWSAKey commuter routes could see
OL,4,A20mph zones imposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Ed Plowden, chair of the
OL,7,Ftransport committee, said: "A
OL,8,Fsignificant number of roads with poor
OL,9,Fsafety records are now proposed to be
OL,10,Fmade safer for everyone."
